              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ayu 9:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.104.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 104:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.10.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 10:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye ndiye anayeketi juu ya duara ya dunia, na hao wanaokaa ndani yake huwa kama panzi; yeye ndiye azitandazaye mbingu kama pazia na kuzikunjua kama hema ya kukaliwa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOB.12.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ayu 12:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ndiye awatanguaye wakuu, na kuwabatilisha waamuzi wa dunia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naam, hawakupandwa; hawakutiwa katika ardhi kama mbegu; naam, shina lao halikutia mizizi katika ardhi; tena awapuzia tu, wakanyauka, upepo wa kisulisuli wawaondoa kama mabua makavu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.4.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kum 4:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.40.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 40:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.17.24+ACT.17.25+ACT.17.26+ACT.17.27+ACT.17.28+ACT.17.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mdo 17:24-29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mtanifananisha na nani, basi, nipate kuwa sawa naye? Asema yeye aliye Mtakatifu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
